WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:06.005
<i>White Lotus 2</i> has way more sex.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:08.375
I've asked to come and watch
some of it.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.476
(LAUGHS)

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.211
I mean, they said it was
a closed set,

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:14.514
but I was able to get in.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:20.353
♪ (HIP HOP MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.356
Can I describe you to you?

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.424
-Yeah, could you?
-(LAUGHS)

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:27.727 line:0%
Well, Tanya,
I think she means well.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:31.797 line:0%
I think she wants to be loved,
and you want that with Greg.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.232
With anybody!

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:37.336
Yes! With anyone,
not just Greg.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:38.838
Hey, where you going?

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.840
Uh, don't you want me
to wash up first?

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.044
It's hot out.
I got swamp crotch.

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.580
He's always thinking of me.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.816
HALEY LU RICHARDSON:
<i>Our characters are very similar,
 actually.</i>

00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:52.819
We both are very self-involved

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.487
in our own kind of pity
and problems,

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.391
and we aren't self-aware
of how we kind of fit

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.826
into the big picture of life.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:02.328
I think I'm much more self-aware
than you.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:05.364
You think Tanya's self-aware?
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:05.631 --> 00:01:07.299
Well, I mean, I think
when you're older,

00:01:07.399 --> 00:01:09.235
you can be a narcissist
but still know

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.437
your incredible limitations.

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.874
And I think when you're young,
you don't even know they exist.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.042
I completely agree with that.

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:19.211
<i> I think that Portia thinks
 that she's not the problem,</i>

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.715
but here she is in Sicily,
and she's just been told

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:26.052
to get lost and basically
not be an assistant anymore.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.454
<i> But she takes it like the end
 of the world.</i>

00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:30.790
I didn't tell you to stop
being an assistant.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.125
I still want you
to do everything.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.259
I need all of your help.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.427
I'm not dismissing you at all.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.862
I want to stay-- stay close
'cause I might need you,

00:01:36.962 --> 00:01:40.833
but just lay low and not come
out of your room. Okay?

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:44.637
That's the thing, too,
about Tanya's version of "help"

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:48.174
and the things she "needs
an assistant for."

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.876
I think in the first episode
is the only time

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:52.512
you really see Portia
kind of being an assistant,

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:56.382
<i> like she comes into the resort
 holding bags</i>

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.250
<i> and telling the bellman
 where to put things.</i>

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.886
But then, when you tell me
to go to my room,

00:02:01.086 --> 00:02:02.555
I'm still kind of on call
for you,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:06.925
but it's really just a lot
of sitting in the other room

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.594
<i> while you're crying, or like,</i>

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.129
-standing there.
-What's wrong with that?

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:13.899
Well, I hope by the next
few episodes, you evolve.

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.969
(CHUCKLES) Yeah!
You think there's hope?

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:20.940
I-- I certainly hope so, because
your lack of appreciation...

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.177
-(CHUCKLING)
-for-- for anything.

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.511
That's true.

00:02:25.611 --> 00:02:26.746
Very entitled.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.080
Yeah.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.650
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.456
I think I would rather
actually go alone

00:02:37.556 --> 00:02:41.327
than with any of the characters
other than Lucia.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.429
<i> She's very beautiful. I mean,
 she actually makes</i>

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.131
<i> most people's trip better.</i>

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.500 line:0%
(SPEAKING ITALIAN)

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.776
I always show up with, like,
eight suitcases

00:02:57.876 --> 00:03:00.379
when I go on a trip, and then,
when you open up the luggage,

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:03.983
it has nothing that I could
possibly wear,

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.685
nothing that's right
for the trip.

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.987
I show up, and I have
all these stupid things

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:09.589
that I don't need
in my hotel room.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:10.690
I don't know why.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.424
Well, also,
it's been freezing here,

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:15.728
and we thought, you know, like
Sicily in the spring and summer,
it's gonna be so hot.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:17.730
<i> But we got here,
 and it's been freezing cold,</i>

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.666
<i> and everyone's bought
 puffer jackets.</i>

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:22.869
(SHIVERING)

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.474
I love the desert.
Like a deserty mountain to hike.

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.476
I don't know if that's
the most popular opinion

00:03:30.576 --> 00:03:33.246
for a vacation, but I feel
most at home in the desert.

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:37.783
I want to always go where
everything is ancient.

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:42.755
You know, I wanna stay
in some really old castle.

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:44.790
When someone says,
"Oh, my god, Jennifer,

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.760
we're gonna go to this place.
We're renting this house,

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.028
and we found it
on a really cool website."

00:03:50.128 --> 00:03:52.598
And I'm like, "Is it old?"

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:56.735
Because if it's not old
and crumbling and cool,

00:03:56.835 --> 00:03:58.371
I have no interest.

